                ["fTxt"] = "\"A Bucket helm? Nope, sorry—who would wear such a thing? It's far too silly and undignified. Be off. …Ha ha ha, fooled you! That sounds splendid! Where can I get one?\" —Sir Cadwell of Codswallop",
